\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Two training traces for the same image (DENTEX, carious FDI 34) and the same expert label. Left: the real radiograph with the with-tools evidence trail --- the returned grounding box (blue), the three corrective \texttt  {nudge\_crop} boxes (orange, light to dark, magnified in the inset; the arrow marks the upward walk from the returned box to the corrected one), and the expert box (green dashed); all coordinates are the values actually returned by the tools, and the right panel shows the crop the teacher finally saw. Middle: the single-turn no-tools trace --- fluent, correct, and unverifiable. Right: the with-tools trace (23 turns, 22 real tool calls), in which the grounding box is inspected, judged wrong, corrected three times, and re-inspected before the answer; quotes are abridged from the released traces. The two arms exist in exact per-cohort 1:1 parity, so the evaluation can vary only the tool interface.}}{14}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:traces}{{10}{14}{Two training traces for the same image (DENTEX, carious FDI 34) and the same expert label. Left: the real radiograph with the with-tools evidence trail --- the returned grounding box (blue), the three corrective \texttt {nudge\_crop} boxes (orange, light to dark, magnified in the inset; the arrow marks the upward walk from the returned box to the corrected one), and the expert box (green dashed); all coordinates are the values actually returned by the tools, and the right panel shows the crop the teacher finally saw. Middle: the single-turn no-tools trace --- fluent, correct, and unverifiable. Right: the with-tools trace (23 turns, 22 real tool calls), in which the grounding box is inspected, judged wrong, corrected three times, and re-inspected before the answer; quotes are abridged from the released traces. The two arms exist in exact per-cohort 1:1 parity, so the evaluation can vary only the tool interface}{figure.caption.18}{}}
\newlabel{fig:traces@cref}{{[figure][10][]10}{[1][13][]14}{}{}{}}
